  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">URPA/OP Cashew Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cashews.Beneficiaries: 1500 (398 women).Description: The group seeks to improve members yields through better orchard management through technical training broadcast by radio by the union; increase the union&apos;s membership base to mobilize larger quantities of cashews and leverage their influence in the market to obtain better prices; Increase efficiencies in mobilization and storage of cashews through the construction of new new strategically placed warehouse complexes in the Union&apos;s area of coverage; and acquire equipment for transport, record keeping, and storage...</narrative>
  </description>
